{"id":"2c42ff9f91beae58","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-denotational.md","title":"Denotational","display":"df-denotational — Denotational","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-denotational","aliases":["58-df-denotational"],"display":"df-denotational — Denotational","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-denotational"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-denotational</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-denotational — Denotational"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"183594346c3dc6c2\" href=\"?note=183594346c3dc6c2\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md\">../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structure with universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (interpretation data for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"183594346c3dc6c2\" href=\"?note=183594346c3dc6c2\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md\">../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (variables and terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\)</span> (constant and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-ary function-symbol components)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(s\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span> (variable assignment)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathrm{cst}}\">\\(I_{\\mathrm{cst}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\">\\(I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\\)</span> (constant and function-symbol interpretation components)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in M^{\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)}\">\\(E\\in M^{\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)}\\)</span> (candidate term-denotation map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TermDenotation}_S(E,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,I,s)\">\\(\\operatorname{TermDenotation}_S(E,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,I,s)\\)</span> (term-denotation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}denotational} \\vdash \\operatorname{TermDenotation}_S(E,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,I,s) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(I,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land s\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\land E\\in M^{\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(E(x)=s(x))\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(E(c)=I_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(E(F(\\bar t))=I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(F)(\\langle E(\\bar t(i))\\rangle_{i\\in n})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}denotational} \\vdash \\operatorname{TermDenotation}_S(E,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,I,s) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(I,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land s\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\land E\\in M^{\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(E(x)=s(x))\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(E(c)=I_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(E(F(\\bar t))=I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(F)(\\langle E(\\bar t(i))\\rangle_{i\\in n})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The three recursive clauses cover variables, constants, and compound function terms.</li>\n<li>Field-theoretic valuations are unrelated to term assignments, so the former valuation dependency has been removed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md","status":"resolved","id":"183594346c3dc6c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md","status":"resolved","id":"183594346c3dc6c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ (interpretation data for $\\mathfrak M$, see [[../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_S$ and $\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)$ (variables and terms, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathrm{cst}}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}","display":false},{"tex":"E\\in M^{\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TermDenotation}_S(E,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,I,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}denotational} \\vdash \\operatorname{TermDenotation}_S(E,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,I,s) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(I,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land s\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\land E\\in M^{\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(E(x)=s(x))\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(E(c)=I_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(E(F(\\bar t))=I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(F)(\\langle E(\\bar t(i))\\rangle_{i\\in n})\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1851,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-407","loc